Version 0.0.1 - Modifications done on the original Go repository

== refactored lsp completion to new version to replace text at cursor
== lsp package is refactored and fixed out from bugs
== removed terminal process implementation as it was not used at all
== reimplemented and fixed all the keyboard actions for the new architecture
== implemented rope string buffer for underlying text manipulation
== remapped some keys and cleaned up keyboard inputs
== fixed and optimized tree sitter highlighter operations
== updated and refactored line buffer and redo/undo stack
== removed files tree codes and io module achieving significant speedup
== removed dap support from the project entirely as it was not maintained
== updated internal logging to use builtin slog feature
== covered characters and clipboard methods with unit test cases
== fixed and optimized syntax highlighting colorization
== optimized scrolling and typing for speed and memory usage
  - updated line buffer as well from the previous 2d content
== removed unused broken git implementation from the project
== speed up and optimization of cut, redo, undo operations
== fixed crashing of process upon opening big files
  - this was caused by spawning lsp processes with incorrect async theads and timing
== transitioned from smacker to native tree-sitter go bindings
  - this was due to the lower level API that is supported natively by the tree sitter dev team
== fixed lsp models, lsp handling routines and added didChange events
== updated default theme of the editor
== disabled autosave feature as it was writing to file all the time
